{"name":"Geyser","hex":"#c4d7cf","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"geyser","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A boiling natural spring which throws forth jets of water, mud, etc., at frequent intervals, driven upwards by the expansive power of steam.","A momentary vertical jet or fountain of fluid driven upwards by a violent force."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To (cause to) rush or burst upward like water from a geyser."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/geyser"}],"entries":[{"title":"Geyser","blocks":[{"text":"A geyser is a spring with an intermittent water discharge ejected turbulently and accompanied by steam. The formation of geysers is fairly rare and is caused by particular hydrogeological conditions that exist only in a few places on Earth."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Yellowstone_National_Park_%28WY%2C_USA%29%2C_Old_Faithful_Geyser_--_2022_--_2599.jpg/330px-Yellowstone_National_Park_%28WY%2C_USA%29%2C_Old_Faithful_Geyser_--_2022_--_2599.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geyser","wikidata":"Q83471"},{"title":"Geyser (song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Geyser\" is a song by American singer Mitski, released on May 14, 2018, as the lead single from her fifth studio album, Be the Cowboy. She performed the song on The Daily Show in September 2018."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/ea/Mitski_-_Geyser.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geyser_(song)","wikidata":"Q115805800"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Steamboat_Geyser_in_Yellowstone.jpg/500px-Steamboat_Geyser_in_Yellowstone.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Steamboat_Geyser_in_Yellowstone.jpg/1280px-St